---
title: Home
description: Find academics attending the same conference and share hotel rooms, rental cars, and other travel costs. Browse featured conferences or search by subject.
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% block content %}
<div class="home-hero">
  <div>
    <h1>Share the room, halve the cost</h1>
    <p>Find academics heading to the same conference as you. Pay half cost and make new friends.</p>
  </div>
  <a href="/create" class="btn btn-primary">Post a request</a>
</div>

<section>
  {# These are the conferences an admin has set `is_featured = 1` on — a curated
     shortlist, NOT "every conference that has posts". The heading has to say
     which, because a featured conference with no posts yet is a normal and
     deliberate state: featuring one ahead of its call for participation is how
     the first person finds somewhere to post. `/conferences` is the complete
     list. See the featuring note in AGENTS.md. #}
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Featured conferences</h2>
    <a href="/conferences" class="section-head-aside">All conferences</a>
  </div>
  <p class="page-lede">A few notable conferences. Every conference on the site is on the <a href="/conferences">full list</a>.</p>
  {# Featured conferences are the largest thing on the page, so they load first
     and the feed below waits its turn. Both are HTMX fragments because this
     page is a static Eleventy asset — see the backlog note in CLAUDE.md. #}
  <div id="featured-conferences"
       hx-get="/api/featured-conferences"
       hx-trigger="load">
    <p class="loading-note">Loading featured conferences…</p>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="hr" />

<div class="home-layout">
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div>
      <h6>Filter posts</h6>
      <form action="/search" method="get" class="filter-stack">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="home-q">Keywords</label>
          <input class="input" id="home-q" type="text" name="q" placeholder="Room share, ride from Boston" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="home-conference">Conference</label>
          <input class="input" id="home-conference" type="text" name="conference" placeholder="Any conference" />
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="home-tag">Subject</label>
          <select class="input" id="home-tag" name="tag" hx-get="/api/components/tag-options" hx-trigger="load" hx-swap="innerHTML">
            <option value="">Any subject</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="filter-row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="home-start">From</label>
            <input class="input" id="home-start" type="date" name="start" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="home-end">To</label>
            <input class="input" id="home-end" type="date" name="end" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit">Search</button>
      </form>
    </div>
    <hr class="hr" />
    <div>
      <h6>How it works</h6>
      <p class="aside-note">Post what you are willing to share, or answer someone who already has. We introduce people by email and step out of the way — read the <a href="/safety">Safety &amp; Scam Awareness Guide</a> before you arrange anything.</p>
      <a href="/how-it-works" class="btn btn-secondary btn-block">Read the guide</a>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <section>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h6>Recent posts, all conferences</h6>
      <span class="section-head-aside">Newest first</span>
    </div>
    <div id="recent-posts"
         hx-get="/api/components/recent-posts"
         hx-trigger="load">
      <p class="loading-note">Loading recent posts…</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
{% endblock %}
